-- (slug) DO NOTHING. One milestone and three pitfalls, each the session's own (proposed). No ruling of Sam's this run:
-- he opened the session and did not write again. Every summary is at most 400 characters, asserted by the script
-- that wrote this file. ROLLBACK: kb/migrations/2026-11-20_s692_checkpoint_memory_rows_rollback.sql
insert into public.cpl_memory (slug,kind,title,summary,tags,status,source,verified_by,verified_at,author,event_date) values
('m-handover-slice-1-merged-2026-11-20','milestone','Hand it over in place, slice 1, merged and deployed','S692, 2026-11-20: #3608 merged as 5507826e. The schema applied through supabase-migrate (run 44789876384; receipt kb/receipts/migration_commons_handover_44789876384.json) and read back live: one storage policy, a reviewer read, no API write. handover-try-link deployed from main (run 44795806048). No hand-over row existed at merge; Sam''s first real drop is the end-to-end check.',array['commons','hand-over','milestone'],'proposed','#3608; kb/receipts/migration_commons_handover_44789876384.json; docs/session_693_handoff.md',null,null,'SkyGannet (S692)',date '2026-11-20'),
('p-lints-stops-at-first-failure-2026-11-20','pitfall','The lints job stops at its first failure, so a second item hides for a full cycle','S692 (#3608): lints failed on the Pages allowlist, then nine minutes and 200 steps later on the single browser installer. After a failure, write each later step''s run block to its own file and run them locally as real scripts before the next push; flattening a multi-line step onto one line breaks its if-then and reports a failure of its own.',array['ci','testing','lints','pitfall'],'proposed','docs/kb-notes/methodology-a-blocked-path-hides-the-defects-behind-it.md; docs/commons_lessons.md, S692',null,null,'SkyGannet (S692)',date '2026-11-20'),
('p-receipt-commit-moves-head-no-ci-2026-11-20','pitfall','The migrate runner''s receipt commit moves the PR head and starts no CI','S692 (#3608): supabase-migrate commits its receipt to the branch with the built-in token, and such a push starts no workflow, so the PR''s head then carries no test check. Push a commit of your own after the last receipt (the note of the applies beside their rollbacks) and gate on test at that head. Put the .apply push first, so one full CI run covers the final head.',array['ci','supabase-migrate','merge-gate','pitfall'],'proposed','docs/commons_lessons.md, S692; .github/workflows/supabase-migrate.yml',null,null,'SkyGannet (S692)',date '2026-11-20'),
('p-new-script-and-browser-install-lints-2026-11-20','pitfall','A new page script needs a Pages publish line; a workflow uses the one browser installer','S692 (#3608): a script a page loads must have a publish line in .github/pages_allowlist.txt (tests/pages_allowlist.test.js), or the deployed site never serves it and the page draws without the feature. A workflow installs Playwright''s browser through scripts/install_browser.sh (tests/browser_install_single_source_test.py), never its own install line.',array['ci','pages','playwright','pitfall'],'proposed','tests/pages_allowlist.test.js; tests/browser_install_single_source_test.py',null,null,'SkyGannet (S692)',date '2026-11-20')
on conflict (slug) do nothing;

